lared n/isolates; float64 little endian and signed zero normalized. IDs excluded. Relabel-invariant conservative structural-context multiset graph fingerprint; rows hash raw x,z,y plus sorted neighbor-degree context. Hash collisions are conservative rejection, not accepted disjointness. No text examples.\",\n    \"generator\": \"NetworkX 3.3; four-block SBM p_in=.04 p_out=.002; BA m=5; WS k=10 rewire=.15. RNG PCG64 with seed +100003*(family ordinal+1). Independent graph/observation statistical seeds across planes.\",\n    \"mechanisms\": \"tau=1; x coefficient .5; unit fixed Gaussian noise sd1. M0 no spill; M1 .25*neighbor mean; M2 2*neighbor mean; M3 2*I(mean>=.75)+z*mean; M4 2*mean(neighbor means), length-two random walks with backtracking; M5 M2 with 32 deterministic balanced graph-BFS clusters: start smallest unassigned node, traverse sorted CSR neighbors, assign up to ceil(n/32), restart at smallest unassigned when frontier empties, discard frontier between clusters. Independent cluster p=.5. Isolate neighbor means=0. Not claimed optimal clustering.\",\n    \"controls\": \"constant y=3.25 on SBM M2, nonidentity reversal of all SBM M2 rows and edges, reset replay first scientific episode; within-plane reuse is intentional. Tolerances atol=rtol=1e-6.\",\n    \"rows\": 3095842,\n    \"graph_fingerprints\": 73,\n    \"split_audit\": {\n      \"normalized_graph_intersections\": 0,\n      \"normalized_raw_example_intersections\": 0,\n      \"checked_before_fitting\": true,\n      \"source_seed_sets_disjoint\": true,\n      \"different_id_duplicate_test\": \"rejected\",\n      \"node_relabel_duplicate_test\": \"rejected\",\n      \"audit_scope\": \"complete production graphs and all six raw experimental mechanisms; matched within-plane controls intentionally reuse input\"\n    },\n    \"preflight\": {\n      \"rpc_operation_counts\": {\n        \"reset\": 625,\n        \"ingest\": 5000,\n        \"fit\": 625,\n        \"predict\": 625\n      },\n      \"rpc_total\": 6